{"pageid":3992,"title":"Bruinia","displaytitle":"Brunia","revid":17761,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n<i>\"Brunia is a unique flower known for its silvery-grey foliage and striking spherical blooms. It is often used in floral arrangements for its elegant and modern appearance, symbolizing resilience and subtle beauty.\"</i>\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Bruinia</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Brunia_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208201348\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Brunia Flower\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Brunia_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208201348\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Brunia_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208201348 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Brunia_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208201348 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Brunia Flower\" width=\"213\" height=\"345\" data-image-key=\"Brunia_Flower.png\" data-image-name=\"Brunia Flower.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\